      "parameters": {
        "width": 720,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## Credentials required before activation\n1. Twilio: Account SID, Auth Token, approved SMS sender, call-status webhook, inbound-message webhook.\n2. Supabase: project URL and service-role credential for the three tables in schema.sql.\n3. LiteLLM/OpenAI-compatible credential: base URL plus API key, configured on both Mistral Chat Model nodes; model alias must resolve to Mistral.\n4. Jobber OAuth2 OR Housecall Pro API credential; configure only the selected CRM branch.\n5. Owner E.164 phone number.\n\nImport note: valid JSON cannot contain comments, so this sticky note is the requested top-of-file credential block. Keep inactive until Twilio signature validation, consent, sender registration, STOP handling, duplicate protection, CRM sandbox creation, and internal-number testing pass. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_* value."
      },
      "position": [
        -520,
        -620
      ]
